tance bands Notices: 1. Please allow 1-2mm differs due to manual measurement, thanks. 2. There could be some slight differences in the color tone of the pictures and the actual item.</p>\n<h3>Supplier specifications</h3><ul><li>High-concerned chemical: none</li><li>Training Site: Waist, ARMS, Legs, Muscle Relex Apparatus, Waist &amp; Abdomen Exercise, Foot, Hand, Wrist, Hip, Chest, Core</li><li>Model Number: 856</li><li>Application: Pull Rope</li><li>Function: Body</li><li>Department Name: Unisex</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Options the seller lists:</strong> Yellow, Red, Black, Purple, Green, Blue</p>\n<p><em>Source: AliExpress listing 1005006860917152, seller Yangchen Chioce Store, captured 2026-09-23. Shipping at capture: Free shipping over 100,00kr Delivery: Oct 03 - 10</em></p>","category","Gym accessories","images",[31,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86,87,88,89,90,91,92],"shippingCostCents","shippingDaysMin","shippingDaysMax","shipsFrom","Mainland China","weightGrams","rating",4.9,"reviewCount",2925,"totalStock","lastSyncedAt",["D",1790121600000],"importedProductId","cmudu11l5001uusu4wpkpvu8l","supplier",{"_69":70,"_71":72,"_73":74,"_75":-5},"name","AliExpress","kind","MANUAL","description","Listings captured from AliExpress product pages. Prices and stock are a snapshot, not a live feed, and orders are placed on AliExpress by hand.","avgHandlingDays","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sfd6b613628a14c4d8a654240bcaab4a7Z.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S726d0f0ef67b4bbb8a495a5cff329f0ct.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sfe34a21d067c45449154c263e83740d6H.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S7166572f2ed941d6a946633bf3c1c667I.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S72e514aa715243ffb28d113bcba7b867h.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S17e4d79a78d249718ed41d1947f874f1A.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S94ecba9a92b5434993f0fc29b3463ec8p.jpg","https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sa7b